{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_1A42FCC7","title":"Thaddeus strange message 2","entry":"Dlg_1A42FCC7::entry","exit":"Dlg_1A42FCC7::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_64F66759","articyId":"72057645577588601","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"An old Thaddeus message has been received.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"An old Thaddeus message has been received.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":275.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41914","byteOffset":30184432,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_C80FEB4F","articyId":"72057645577588607","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"I would share a lesson from history, if you would listen. If I told anyone else, it would not mean much. It would be like whispering it to myself.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I would share a lesson from history, if you would listen. If I told anyone else, it would not mean much. It would be like whispering it to myself.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36256","byteOffset":28062656,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_A04C9056","articyId":"72057645577588621","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I don't. Chronologically this is the oldest. By far. It is from two hundred years ago. It was scheduled to only unlock now.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't. Chronologically this is the oldest. By far. It is from two hundred years ago. It was scheduled to only unlock now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":875.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50967","byteOffset":33620904,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_05FEDF18","articyId":"72057645577588635","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I am sure of its age. I don't know why it was scheduled to come now.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am sure of its age. I don't know why it was scheduled to come now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34229","byteOffset":20832608,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_52C1897D","articyId":"72057645577588651","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have double-checked the message's origin. There is no corruption.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have double-checked the message's origin. There is no corruption.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2675.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16892","byteOffset":14281416,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_D57EEC04","articyId":"72057645577588658","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"They say history repeats itself every eighty years. In all my research - and I have done plenty now - I would say it is closer to eighty two. And within that span, there are four phases. I call them \"Saeculums\".","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They say history repeats itself every eighty years. In all my research - and I have done plenty now - I would say it is closer to eighty two. And within that span, there are four phases. I call them \"Saeculums\".","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43185","byteOffset":30666592,"byteLength":556}},{"id":"DFr_6FFDF567","articyId":"72057645577588665","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"A history lesson then it seems.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A history lesson then it seems.","TextSheVersion":"A history lesson then it seems.","TextTheyVersion":"A history lesson then it seems."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41974","byteOffset":30206576,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_A5A06548","articyId":"72057645577588672","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Saeculum one is twenty years of progress where civilization is built on a bullet train as we hurtle into the sunlight. Saeculum two is awareness, when we open our eyes and see the way ahead, and those around us too.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Saeculum one is twenty years of progress where civilization is built on a bullet train as we hurtle into the sunlight. Saeculum two is awareness, when we open our eyes and see the way ahead, and those around us too.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3575.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49218","byteOffset":32962088,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_92733F94","articyId":"72057645577588679","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have heard this theory before, but some of his terms are new to me.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have heard this theory before, but some of his terms are new to me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3875.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48897","byteOffset":32839600,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_050945BE","articyId":"72057645577588686","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Saeculum three is unbinding, when we free ourselves of our invisible bonds, but shed the connections between one another too. Finally, Saeculum four is rending... upheaval, regression and finally, collapse.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Saeculum three is unbinding, when we free ourselves of our invisible bonds, but shed the connections between one another too. Finally, Saeculum four is rending... upheaval, regression and finally, collapse.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4175.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16998","byteOffset":14321768,"byteLength":552}},{"id":"DFr_2B7190D8","articyId":"72057645577588714","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Even in your life you would have seen these events. The invention of the vapor-powered HOVA, leading to the redevelopment of Luna and the marches at the Eastern Peninsula for emancipation. But eighty years ago... the Corp wars, and the establishment of CorpSec.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Even in your life you would have seen these events. The invention of the vapor-powered HOVA, leading to the redevelopment of Luna and the marches at the Eastern Peninsula for emancipation. But eighty years ago... the Corp wars, and the establishment of CorpSec.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4775.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26601","byteOffset":17943416,"byteLength":572}},{"id":"DFr_E10AF0C9","articyId":"72057645577588722","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"So we are due another... \"rending\". A cataclysm.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So we are due another... \"rending\". A cataclysm.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5075.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41454","byteOffset":30010432,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_7C937469","articyId":"72057645577588729","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"The cycle repeats, even when we leave this planet and fill the stars with our seed. It's like the eighty year cycle is in our DNA. Our source code. We can't escape it, and we DON'T escape it. I've checked.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The cycle repeats, even when we leave this planet and fill the stars with our seed. It's like the eighty year cycle is in our DNA. Our source code. We can't escape it, and we DON'T escape it. I've checked.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5375.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31151","byteOffset":19666248,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_4F13491A","articyId":"72057645577588736","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"That's the end of the message. Though I am sure Thaddeus has more to say.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's the end of the message. Though I am sure Thaddeus has more to say.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5675.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38357","byteOffset":28845760,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_BAB0D13A","articyId":"72057821671327657","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"I am sooo interested!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am sooo interested!","TextSheVersion":"I am sooo interested!","TextTheyVersion":"I am sooo interested!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41945","byteOffset":30195288,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_4F97DDB9","articyId":"72057645577588614","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you mean a NEW message?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you mean a NEW message?","TextSheVersion":"Do you mean a NEW message?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you mean a NEW message?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":575.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24247","byteOffset":17049160,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_3B1DF842","articyId":"72057645577588628","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh?","TextSheVersion":"Huh?","TextTheyVersion":"Huh?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26540","byteOffset":17920272,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_AD5EDA06","articyId":"72